  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After obtaining the immortal killer move time assist luck from Fairy Li Shan, Fang Yuan finds the concept familiar and asks where she got it. She says she is unable to answer. He wonders whether it is from a lone cultivator of Northern Plains, Zhou Ye Zi.",
      "chapters": [
        815
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This person was very famous during the five regions chaotic war. He was originally a secluded cultivator who did not bother with worldly affairs. When Northern Plains and Central Continent Gu Immortals fought a huge battle that went to the area he was staying in, he raged and instantly captured three Gu Immortals on the spot. Northern Plains asked him to fight. He refused, but because they were on the same side he used a time path killer move on the Northern Plains Gu Immortals to protect their lives.",
      "chapters": [
        815
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That killer move had a weird name, only one word: Delay. It delayed damage, leaving time to heal, escape, or pass on resources. Its appearance reduced Northern Plains casualties and helped stall Central Continent’s push. Fang Yuan guesses that if it really is Zhou Ye Zi, then Fairy Li Shan’s ability to delay the damage of an alliance agreement would be Delay, and that she paid a high price to get this lone cultivator to help. From start to finish, Fairy Li Shan does not expose any information regarding him.",
      "chapters": [
        815
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yin Wu Que, facing Hei Lou Lan, thinks his method has only failed against Tian Xia Xin and Zhou Ye Zi. He classifies Zhou Ye Zi as cultivating time path, with an investigative method that could peer a few breaths into the future.",
      "chapters": [
        2169
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "investigative-method",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yin_wu_que",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_tian_xia_xin"
      ]
    }
  ],
